   00001| //! Append-only event log for the universal solver.
   00002| //!
   00003| //! Every step the solver takes is recorded as a content-addressed event
   00004| //! before the user-facing answer is built. The answer is then a projection
   00005| //! of the log — see `VISION.md` and `GOALS.md` for the rationale.
   00006| //!
   00007| //! The log is intentionally small: it lives in-process, holds plain Rust
   00008| //! records, and uses the same FNV-1a 64-bit hash that `engine::stable_id`
   00009| //! uses so identifiers stay stable across surfaces.
   00010| 
   00011| use crate::engine::{ThinkingStep, stable_id};
   00012| use crate::link_store::{LinkStore, LinkStoreError};
   00013| use crate::memory::MemoryEvent;
